{"id":"489126","name":"牛肉粉丝萝卜汤","author":"天下美食diy","authorId":"8356173","desc":"","cover":"images/489126/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"牛肉馅","amount":"250g"},{"name":"粉丝","amount":"150g"}],"sub":[{"name":"红萝卜","amount":"1个"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1个"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"味精","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"淀粉","amount":"少许"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"少许"},{"name":"葱","amount":"少许"},{"name":"姜","amount":"少许"},{"name":"十三香","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"牛肉馅放入碗中。","img":"images/489126/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加葱姜末。","img":"images/489126/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"盐，鸡精，味精，十三香。","img":"images/489126/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"生抽。","img":"images/489126/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"蛋清。","img":"images/489126/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"淀粉。","img":"images/489126/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"用筷子一个方向搅拌上劲。","img":"images/489126/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"红萝卜插成丝。","img":"images/489126/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"大勺内加少许油，放入葱姜丝炒出香味。","img":"images/489126/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入萝卜丝炒软。","img":"images/489126/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加水没过萝卜。","img":"images/489126/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"加盐鸡精味精调味。","img":"images/489126/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"加入泡软的粉丝。","img":"images/489126/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"水开放入丸子。煮8分钟，打去浮沫，点入一点香油出锅。","img":"images/489126/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"大功告成，有不懂的老铁可以私信我，求关注，求收藏。","img":"images/489126/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}